 常有18～25歲的大學生前來用餐，青春氣息滿滿～",null,[0,70]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/974207715839783898/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3ZGxSc1ZubFZTRXBHV25rd2QxTXlkSGxQUjNoTFVqTmFXbGd6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/974207715839783898/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3ZGxSc1ZubFZTRXBHV25rd2QxTXlkSGxQUjNoTFVqTmFXbGd6WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/974207715839783898/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3ZGxSc1ZubFZTRXBHV25rd2QxTXlkSGxQUjNoTFVqTmFXbGd6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/974207715839783898/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3ZGxSc1ZubFZTRXBHV25rd2QxTXlkSGxQUjNoTFVqTmFXbGd6WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/974207715839783898/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3ZGxSc1ZubFZTRXBHV25rd2QxTXlkSGxQUjNoTFVqTmFXbGd6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/974207715839783898/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3ZGxSc1ZubFZTRXBHV25rd2QxTXlkSGxQUjNoTFVqTmFXbGd6WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,56911,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wdlRsVnlVSEpGWnkwd1MydHlPR3hLUjNaWlgzYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xa48a8b8ecd48af6f!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmpvTlVyUHJFZy0wS2tyOGxKR3ZZX3c%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wdlRsVnlVSEpGWnkwd1MydHlPR3hLUjNaWlgzYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wdlRsVnlVSEpGWnkwd1MydHlPR3hLUjNaWlgzYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wdlRsVnlVSEpGWnkwd1MydHlPR3hLUjNaWlgzYxILMGQyNGdDcTdjbm8aPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09tcHZUbFZ5VUhKRlp5MHdTMnR5T0d4S1IzWlpYM2MSCzBkMjRnQ3E3Y25vIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARb69IzY6LiqQqCzBkMjRnQ3E3Y25v\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjb_5GYu9KWAxW8evUHHQBrBHYQoy